> - Seven escapes, and no others: `\n` `\t` `\r` `\\` `\"` and `\xNN`, a byte in
>   hex from `01` to `7f` (`\x41` is `A`), in a string, `\'` instead of `\"` in
>   a character literal. Any other escape is a compile error.
